and fields, update existing information, confirm that information is still
current, or challenge information that is obsolete, incorrect or suspicious.
Normal users do not directly delete shared knowledge. Every revision preser=
ves
history, enabling correction, rollback, archiving and a visual =93shadow ro=
ute=94
showing how a route has changed over time.</p>

