results
present multiple compact ribbons when multiple routes exist. The visitor
compares approximate duration, expected departure window, number of followe=
rs,
recent activity, route maturity and major visual stages before choosing one=
 to
open.</p>

<h2 style=3D'margin-top:7.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.0pt;margin-l=
eft:
0cm'><span style=3D'font-size:12.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;line-height:=
115%;
font-family:"Aptos",sans-serif;color:#1E6A73'>8.3 Detailed route use</span>=
</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:5.0pt;line-height:107%'>Selecti=
ng a
ribbon expands it into a road. Major steps can be opened to reveal detailed
procedure and fields. The user should be able to collapse the detail and re=
turn
to the visual journey at any time.</p>

<h2 style=3D'margin-top:7.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.0pt;margin-l=
eft:
0cm'><span style=3D'font-size:12.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;line-height:=
115%;
font-family:"Aptos",sans-serif;color:#1E6A73'>8.4 Optional personal trackin=
g</span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:5.0pt;line-height:107%'>A signe=
d-in
user may follow a route. This creates a private journey view where the user
marks progress, records personal dates or notes, and sees route changes
relevant to unfinished stages.</p>

<h2 style=3D'margin-top:7.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.0pt;margin-l=
eft:
0cm'><span style=3D'font-size:12.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;line-height:=
115%;
font-family:"Aptos",sans-serif;color:#1E6A73'>8.5 Community feedback loop</=
span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:5.0pt;line-height:107%'>After a=
 user
completes or experiences a step, the platform should make it easy to confirm
that the public information was correct or to suggest an update if it was n=
ot.
This converts fresh firsthand experience into reusable knowledge for future
students.</p>

<h1 style=3D'margin-top:11.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:4.0pt;margin-=
left:
0cm'><span style=3D'font-size:16.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;line-height:=
115%;
font-family:"Aptos",sans-serif;color:#18324A'>9. Route Search and Discovery=
</span></h1>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:5.0pt;line-height:107%'>Route d=
iscovery
should start with a small number of understandable filters. The system may
later support more filters, but it should not require a detailed student
profile before showing useful information.</p>

