an></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:5.0pt;line-height:107%'>A route=
 should
initially appear as a compact horizontal visual ribbon rather than a
conventional rectangular information card. The ribbon is a compressed
representation of the future road. Its colored segments correspond to major
categories of steps and provide a quick visual sense of length and sequence=
.</p>

