0cm'><span style=3D'font-size:16.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;line-height:=
115%;
font-family:"Aptos",sans-serif;color:#18324A'>14. Shadow Route and Change
Comparison</span></h1>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:5.0pt;line-height:107%'>A defin=
ing
visual feature is the shadow of a previous route/version beneath or alongsi=
de
the current route. The objective is to let a user understand the scale of
change visually rather than only through a text log.</p>

