 New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]>The visible domain/destination should be
understandable before a user leaves the platform.</p>

<p class=3DMsoListBulletCxSpMiddle style=3D'margin-bottom:2.5pt;mso-add-spa=
ce:auto;
