<h2>39.3 Conflicting edits and edit wars</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>A signed-in user may update a field that another signe=
d-in
user previously updated. Each update creates a new revision rather than
destroying the earlier value. If a field changes repeatedly within a short
period or receives simultaneous confirmations and challenges, the platform
should make that instability visible instead of silently presenting the lat=
